\title{An elementary form of the circle covariance}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{The covariance of the continuous field is the Green function
of \ref{fdip-00BG}. That function depends on the shorter arc
between the two points. Which elementary expression matches
it, and what growth condition does a Euclidean reconstruction
use?}
